the thrill of the Gold Rush alone or join forces with friends, exploring a vast world of endless possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379820/extras/4a041a0d382a4fd06068c2f182575c5b.poster.avif?t=1749582427\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379820/extras/4a041a0d382a4fd06068c2f182575c5b.webm?t=1749582427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379820/extras/4a041a0d382a4fd06068c2f182575c5b.mp4?t=1749582427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Role-Play Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path, Cowboy or Native American, each with unique skills and quests, in a rich role-playing experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379820/extras/f24858be045b0fd41584bc6e78ac30a3.poster.avif?t=1749582427\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379820/extras/f24858be045b0fd41584bc6e78ac30a3.webm?t=1749582427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379820/extras/f24858be045b0fd41584bc6e78ac30a3.mp4?t=1749582427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Skill System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a rich skill progression system, enhancing your abilities and standing out among other pioneers through quests and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Forty-Niner now and be part of a community shaping the frontier, with exclusive rewards for early supporters.</strong></p>",
